, annote =      "Advancing front scheme. Tri that maximizes $A/P^2$ is
                 chosen."
, abstract =    "A new mesh generator, capable of discretizing
                 arbitrary, two-dimensional, multiply connected domains
                 into triangles with a prescribed spatial density, has
                 been developed. The technique is based on stripwise
                 automatic triangulation. The triangulation strategy has
                 been enhanced using two heuristics. The first is a
                 method to temporarily reorient a region before
                 submitting it for generation. The second is a technique
                 to find and repair 'omitted patches' near sharply
                 curved boundaries. Despite employing a set of
                 heuristics, the resulting scheme is versatile, robust,
                 and demonstrates a near linear growth rate. (Author
                 abstract) 17 Refs."
