, abstract =    "
 We consider the  motion  planning problem  for a point  constrained to
 move along a  smooth (C1) closed (cycle)
 convex  path  of  bounded curvature.  The
 workspace of  the moving point  is bounded by  a convex polygon with m
 vertices, containing an obstacle in a form  of a simple polygon with n
