                 propose an approach to these two tasks which proceeds
                 from the level of a complete feature (for example, a
                 pocket or channel). The result is a more direct method
                 for modeling functional surface characteristics and a
                 more efficient feature-based implementation of Delaunay
                 surface triangulation. (Author abstract) 10 Refs."
